---
import DocsLayout from '@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import { DocsTable, Callout } from '@/molecules/DocComponents/DocComponents';

const SETTINGS = [
  ['OPENFLOWS_MODE', 'Local or hosted Manager mode'],
  ['OPENFLOWS_PUBLIC_URL', 'Public HTTPS origin used for callbacks and links'],
  ['OPENFLOWS_DATABASE_URL', 'Manager PostgreSQL connection'],
  ['OPENFLOWS_REDIS_ADMIN_URL', 'Redis administration and tenant ACL provisioning'],
  ['OPENFLOWS_RUNTIME_REDIS_URL', 'Redis address reachable from workspaces'],
  ['OPENFLOWS_GITHUB_APP_ID', 'GitHub App identity for repository operations'],
  ['OPENFLOWS_CODER_OPERATOR_TOKEN_REF', 'Secret reference for Manager workspace provisioning'],
  ['OPENFLOWS_RELEASE_SOURCE', 'Configured immutable template release source'],
];
---

<DocsLayout breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Docs', href: '/docs' }, { label: 'Reference', href: '/docs/reference' }, { label: 'Configuration Reference' }]}>
  <h1>Configuration reference</h1>
  <p>Manager configuration is operator-owned. It includes the public origin, databases, Redis, GitHub Apps, Coder, secret references, and template releases. Changes to these settings generally require validation and a service restart; they are not all editable from the user web interface.</p>
  <DocsTable headers={['Setting', 'Purpose']} rows={SETTINGS} />
  <h2 id="secrets">Secrets</h2>
  <p>Secret reference settings point to values in the configured provider. Do not place the GitHub App private key, Coder operator token, or master encryption key into a Coder template or workspace parameter. Manager resolves them within its trusted boundary.</p>
  <h2 id="validation">Validate before serving</h2>
  <p>Use <code>openflows-manager setup</code> to bootstrap supported integrations and <code>openflows-manager doctor</code> to check configuration, external services, and secrets. Use <code>openflows-manager serve</code> only after the required checks pass.</p>
  <Callout type="info" title="Complete versioned reference">Configuration evolves with releases. The <a href="https://github.com/The-AgenticFlow/OpenFlows/blob/main/crates/openflows-manager/src/config.rs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manager configuration source</a> and <a href="https://github.com/The-AgenticFlow/OpenFlows/tree/main/docs/implementation/centralized-deployment" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">operator guide</a> are the version-specific references.</Callout>
</DocsLayout>
